  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197530",
      "title": "Adding & Using Custom Fonts with React Native Apps",
      "lectureOrder": 70,
      "videoOrder": 67,
      "sourceHash": "aa3c943098a44e02db51541abbebc6984c08148db6fb2d91db84043f4fe9e1b2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.09,
          "en": "So now, with the icons added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.09,
          "end": 5.75,
          "en": "let's talk about fonts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 9.05,
          "en": "because we also sometimes wanna use custom fonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.05,
          "end": 13.403,
          "en": "And again, thankfully Expo makes this pretty easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.36,
          "end": 16.3,
          "en": "For this, we can go to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.3,
          "end": 19.34,
          "en": "because we wanna set up our own fonts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.34,
          "end": 21.16,
          "en": "in the root component of the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.16,
          "end": 24.27,
          "en": "so that they are loaded when the app starts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.27,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "because custom fonts have to be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 28.41,
          "en": "and we wanna do this early on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.41,
          "end": 30.253,
          "en": "when the app starts, typically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.49,
          "end": 33.66,
          "en": "Now custom fonts can be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.66,
          "end": 36.4,
          "en": "with help of a extra package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.4,
          "end": 38.43,
          "en": "This extra package must be installed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.43,
          "end": 41.03,
          "en": "and we can do this with expo install,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.03,
          "end": 44.67,
          "en": "and the package name is expo-font.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.67,
          "end": 48.46,
          "en": "With that, this package gets installed into our project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.46,
          "end": 50.46,
          "en": "I still have the npm-start process running",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.46,
          "end": 51.35,
          "en": "in a different tab,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.35,
          "end": 54.15,
          "en": "but I'm all installing this package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.15,
          "end": 57.11,
          "en": "And once this is installed in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.11,
          "end": 61.26,
          "en": "we can import something from expo-font,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.26,
          "end": 63.95,
          "en": "and that something is a hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.95,
          "end": 66.74,
          "en": "a React Hook, exposed by this package,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.74,
          "end": 68.053,
          "en": "the useFonts hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.77,
          "end": 71.27,
          "en": "This hook can be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.27,
          "end": 73.76,
          "en": "and must be called in an app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.76,
          "end": 78.496,
          "en": "In this case, in our root app component to load these fonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.496,
          "end": 79.93,
          "en": "UseFont is executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 79.93,
          "end": 81.6,
          "en": "and to useFonts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.6,
          "end": 83.85,
          "en": "you pass an object with instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 83.85,
          "end": 86.72,
          "en": "about which fonts should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 86.72,
          "end": 88.66,
          "en": "Now, if you dive into the official",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.66,
          "end": 91.71000000000001,
          "en": "Expo Fonts documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.71000000000001,
          "end": 95.41,
          "en": "you'll learn how you could easily include fonts from Google",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.41,
          "end": 99.5,
          "en": "because including Google Fonts is made extra simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.5,
          "end": 103.24000000000001,
          "en": "with help of a special Expo Google Fonts Package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 103.24000000000001,
          "end": 106.09,
          "en": "That might be worth a closer look as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.09,
          "end": 109.84,
          "en": "Here, I wanna show you how to include any kind of fonts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.84,
          "end": 113.83,
          "en": "where you might just have your local font files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.83,
          "end": 115.49000000000001,
          "en": "and therefore in the assets folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 115.49000000000001,
          "end": 118.07,
          "en": "I'll add a fonts sub-folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.07,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "and attached to this lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 122.53,
          "en": "you'll find two font files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.53,
          "end": 126.77,
          "en": "which you should download and add to this fonts folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.77,
          "end": 129.23,
          "en": "The OpenSans-Boldttf file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.23,
          "end": 132.253,
          "en": "and the OpenSans-Regularttf file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.15,
          "end": 134.67,
          "en": "These two files are attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 134.67,
          "end": 135.92,
          "en": "and you should download them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.92,
          "end": 138.893,
          "en": "and add them to the fonts folder in the assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.8,
          "end": 141.49,
          "en": "Now, once you added them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.49,
          "end": 144.7,
          "en": "they can be loaded with help of useFonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 144.7,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "For this, in this useFonts object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 149.55,
          "en": "you must set up property names",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.55,
          "end": 153.25,
          "en": "that will later be used for identifying the fonts you loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.25,
          "end": 155.65,
          "en": "and values for these property names,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.65,
          "end": 159.17000000000002,
          "en": "that point to these files that should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 159.17000000000002,
          "end": 162.427,
          "en": "So for example, this font is called OpenSans",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 162.427,
          "end": 165.51,
          "en": "so I'll use open-sans as a property name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 165.51,
          "end": 168.28,
          "en": "between quotes, since this name includes a dash,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 168.28,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "and it would be a invalid JavaScript property otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 176.97,
          "en": "And then to load the font and assign it to this identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 176.97,
          "end": 178.97,
          "en": "we use this require function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 178.97,
          "end": 181.69,
          "en": "which we already know from images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 181.69,
          "end": 183.26,
          "en": "And here, just as for images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 183.26,
          "end": 185.93,
          "en": "we construct the path to this font",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.93,
          "end": 187.13,
          "en": "that should be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 187.13,
          "end": 192,
          "en": "In this case, it's OpenSans-Regularttf.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192,
          "end": 194.59,
          "en": "And make sure you introduce no typo here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 194.59,
          "end": 197.39,
          "en": "because otherwise loading that font will of course fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.9,
          "end": 200.35,
          "en": "Now, we also have to bold version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 200.35,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "for this I'll load open-sans-bold here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 202.86,
          "end": 206.513,
          "en": "and point at OpenSansttf like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 208.98,
          "end": 210.97,
          "en": "This will load these fonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.97,
          "end": 212.98,
          "en": "Now, what you should typically do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.98,
          "end": 215.8,
          "en": "is that whilst these fonts are loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.8,
          "end": 218.06,
          "en": "you wanna show a loading screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 218.06,
          "end": 221.06,
          "en": "or you wanna show the splash screen of the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.06,
          "end": 223.14,
          "en": "which is the app loading screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.14,
          "end": 225.653,
          "en": "until the fonts have been initialized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.55,
          "end": 227.383,
          "en": "And to do this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 227.383,
          "end": 231.43,
          "en": "we can install another package with expo install,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 231.43,
          "end": 235.133,
          "en": "and that would be the expo-app-loading package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.15,
          "end": 240.46,
          "en": "This gives us a utility component, which we can render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 240.46,
          "end": 243.02,
          "en": "which will prolong the splash screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.02,
          "end": 246.51,
          "en": "and will ensure that the splash screen is still shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.51,
          "end": 248.113,
          "en": "until some condition is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.31,
          "end": 250.92,
          "en": "So now with this package installed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 250.92,
          "end": 254.943,
          "en": "we can import app-loading from expo-app loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 256.52,
          "end": 259.483,
          "en": "and we wanna show this as long as we're loading fonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.37,
          "end": 263.183,
          "en": "Now to find out if we are still loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 263.183,
          "end": 267.13,
          "en": "useFunds, thankfully returns an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.13,
          "end": 268.98,
          "en": "where the first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 268.98,
          "end": 271.73,
          "en": "which we can extract with array destructuring,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 271.73,
          "end": 273.753,
          "en": "as we did it for useState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 274.61,
          "end": 277.86,
          "en": "where the first element is actually a boolean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 277.86,
          "end": 279.95,
          "en": "that indicates whether the fonts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 279.95,
          "end": 281.83299999999997,
          "en": "have been loaded yet or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 282.75,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "So we can now use this boolean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 286.73,
          "en": "to render our app loading component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 286.73,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "which will then show the splash screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 290.863,
          "en": "until the fonts have been loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 291.82,
          "end": 294.40999999999997,
          "en": "So here I'll check if not fonts loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 294.40999999999997,
          "end": 297.08,
          "en": "so if we are still loading,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 297.08,
          "end": 301.47,
          "en": "and in that case, I will return AppLaoding like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 301.47,
          "end": 303.64,
          "en": "So in that case, I will show the splash screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 303.64,
          "end": 305.57,
          "en": "and once the fonts have been loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 305.57,
          "end": 307.78,
          "en": "the component will be re-executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 307.78,
          "end": 311.223,
          "en": "and then we will not show the splash screen anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 312.2,
          "end": 313.033,
          "en": "But now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 313.033,
          "end": 314.7,
          "en": "we can use our custom fonts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 314.7,
          "end": 318.12,
          "en": "because that is of course the main reason for loading them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 318.12,
          "end": 320.63,
          "en": "And it's up to you where you wanna use them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 320.63,
          "end": 321.83,
          "en": "but I, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 321.83,
          "end": 326.21,
          "en": "wanna use my fonts in different places of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 326.21,
          "end": 329.29,
          "en": "For example, I wanna use my fonts here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 329.29,
          "end": 332.49,
          "en": "in the Title and Instruction text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 332.49,
          "end": 335.53,
          "en": "and NumberContainer elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 335.53,
          "end": 339.49,
          "en": "And therefore, in Title.js to use my custom font,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 339.49,
          "end": 342.81,
          "en": "we can, by the way, remove the colors import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 342.81,
          "end": 344.62,
          "en": "since we don't need it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 344.62,
          "end": 346.85,
          "en": "But here to use the custom font",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 346.85,
          "end": 348.6,
          "en": "all we have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 348.6,
          "end": 351.5,
          "en": "is go to our style object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 351.5,
          "end": 354.55,
          "en": "and add the fontFamily property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 354.55,
          "end": 356.423,
          "en": "as we would do it in CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 357.26,
          "end": 359.47,
          "en": "And now we can use these identifiers,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 359.47,
          "end": 361.41,
          "en": "that we assigned in the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.41,
          "end": 365.14,
          "en": "So in my case, open-sans or open-sans-bold.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 365.14,
          "end": 368.39,
          "en": "And here I wanna use open-sans-bold",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 368.39,
          "end": 370.37,
          "en": "since I wanna have some bold text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 370.37,
          "end": 372.75,
          "en": "We can now remove the fontWeight here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 372.75,
          "end": 375.713,
          "en": "because this font which we load, is already bold.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 376.91,
          "end": 378.22,
          "en": "Now in the InstructionText",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
